<div>
  <h2>The Solution</h2>

  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">The Birth of a Franchise</p>
    <p>
      I set the creative direction by looking to the classics for an ongoing
      narrative: comic books. The Tfue Tuesday brand debuted as a graphic
      novel-inspired event, giving it a dynamic, evolving visual identity that
      instantly communicated there was more to come.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

