<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Comic Book Staple: The Return</p>
  <p>
    After taking a very public hiatus from the streaming world, Tfue eventually
    returned to the spotlight. For Vol. 3, I directed the team to capture the
    classic comic book storyline of a hero's return. Tfue returned to streaming
    with a new installment of Tfue Tuesday, making the event feel like a
    cultural moment in competitive Fortnite.
  </p>
